    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "We are delighted to bring to the market Ardauling, an attractive detached bungalow enjoying an elevated setting with impressive views over Youghal Bay, together with the benefit of extensive recent renovation and improvement works.  The property has undergone a programme of recent renovation and upgrading works including flooring, complete internal and external repainting, replacement external underground drainage and the renewal of the concrete pathways surrounding the house."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Accommodation comprises :-\r\nLiving Room\t\r\n6.10m x 3.94m\t\r\nTimber floor, open fire with brick surround, dual window aspect, power points, T.V. point.\r\n\r\nKitchen\r\n3.80m x 3.41m\t\r\nTimber floor, power points, access to rear, plumbed for washing machine/dishwasher.\r\n\r\nBedroom\t\r\n2.42m x 3.33m\t\r\nTimber floor, power points.\r\n\r\nBedroom\r\n3.82m x 2.70m\t\r\nTimber floor, power points.\r\n\r\nBedroom\t\r\n0.57m x 3.34m\t\r\nTimber floor, power points.\r\n\r\nBathroom\t\r\n2.75m x 1.50m\t\r\nTile floor, W.H.B. W.C., bath/shower unit, radiator.\r\n\r\nServices:\t\r\nMains Water, Mains Sewerage."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Internally, the accommodation is bright, fresh and well proportioned. The spacious living room features a large picture window which takes full advantage of the elevated outlook, together with a traditional fireplace providing a central focal point.  The kitchen/dining area is generously proportioned and offers excellent potential for a purchaser to install a kitchen to their own specification. A large window and glazed external door provide excellent natural light.  The bedroom accommodation comprises bright and \r\nwell-proportioned rooms, complemented by the recently renewed flooring and neutral decorative finish.\r\nThe bathroom is fitted with a bath, wash-hand basin and WC.  Externally the property benefits from mature gardens together with an attached garage providing valuable additional storage and further potential for development, subject to necessary planning permission. Ardauling represents an excellent opportunity to acquire a detached home in a mature residential setting, with a picturesque coastal outlook.  \r\nViewing comes highly recommended.\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\nAttractive detached bungalow on an elevated setting with views over Youghal Bay.\r\n\r\nRenovation works include internal and external painting, underground, drainage pipework replaced, original clay drainage pipes replaced with Wavin\r\npipework, concrete pathways, surrounding the house replaced.  Ardauling was also underpinned in 2023.\r\n\r\nLarge attic space offering excellent potential for conversion/extension.\r\n\r\nMay qualify for grants such as the Vacant Property Refurbishment Grant and National Home Energy Upgrade Scheme, subject to purchaser eligibility and the applicable terms and conditions.\r\n\r\nJust a mere 15 minute walk to Youghal town centre and 25 minute drive to Dungarvan."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: G"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Viewing Details",
        "SortOrder": 6,
        "Content": "By appointment with Collins O'Meara Ltd., Auctioneers & Valuers, FBA House, Cork Road, Fermoy, Co. Cork P61 DY66  025/31000\r\nEmail : enquiries@collinsomeara.com"
      }
    ],
